# fun.hammer

A pump.fun-style launchpad for the fun.hammer ecosystem.

## Stack
- Next.js app for the frontend
- Solana-compatible wallet flow
- Hardhat for smart contract scaffolding
- Prisma-ready indexer

## Getting started

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Smart contracts

```bash
npx hardhat compile
npx hardhat test
```

## Notes
This repository includes a starter launchpad UI and basic token/Dex contract templates for a pump-style token ecosystem.
